{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the base against relentless massive waves of hostile aquatic creatures, strengthen your defenses and stay one step ahead of the aquatic threats as you battle across diverse biomes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617440/extras/406059661c29b4bb68fa20be8869ed72.poster.avif?t=1751976478\" width=718 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617440/extras/406059661c29b4bb68fa20be8869ed72.webm?t=1751976478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617440/extras/406059661c29b4bb68fa20be8869ed72.mp4?t=1751976478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless Idle Combat:</strong> Automated turrets lock on and engage enemies, to enjoy the action hands free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Waves:</strong> Survive until EMP charges, earning credit per kill before an EMP clears the rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System: </strong>Enhance the defenses with tiered improvements from energy shield to chain lightning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Unlocked Skill Trees: </strong>Discover randomized upgrade paths each run, ensuring fresh strategies and surprises every time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive VFX:</strong> Feast your eyes on spectacular particle bursts that bring every turret blast and creature takedown to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Scale:</strong> Engage in thrilling combat against up to 10000 enemies simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Biomes:</strong> Defend aga